application_process:
Apply through Incubators : 
1. Start up Incubation and Innovation Centre SIIC, IIT Kanpur;
2. Society for Innovation & Entrepreneurship (SINE), IIT Bombay;
3. Coimbatore Innovation and Business Incubator (Forge Accelerator) Coimbatore
4. KIIT Technology Business Incubator, KIIT University, Bhubaneswar

who_can_apply:
1. The event is open to the following who may participate as individuals, teams, startups, etc. and may work individually or as a team on ideas/concepts/solutions and present use cases for the 5G & Beyond products/solutions.
2. Students, Startups owned and controlled by Resident Indian Citizens, academic institutions in India;
3. Employees of the Department of Telecommunications (DoT), India Mobile Congress (IMC), Digital Communication Square Scheme (DCIS) Beneficiaries or Startups connected with them as promoters/partners are not eligible;
4. Products/Solutions given by Startups which have already been selected in the earlier 5G hackathon shall not be eligible;
5. Products/Solutions shall be connected to 5G & Beyond. Ideas without a basic connection to these technologies shall not be eligible.

eligibility_criteria:
The innovators and Startups aspiring to avail this could be in any stage as below:
i. A school student of Foundational/Preparatory/Middle/Secondary level (Up to Class 12);
ii. A Diploma / Vocational / Undergraduate / Postgraduate / Doctoral student or an alumna/alumnus;
iii. Any dropout from school/institute/university, from Gujarat.
